{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07365","headline":"初贬南巴至鄱阳题李嘉佑江亭 · 刘长卿","name":"初贬南巴至鄱阳题李嘉佑江亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"南出巴人徼，长江万里随。\n不才甘谪去，流水亦何之。\n地逺明君弃，天髙酷吏欺。\n青山独往路，芳草未归时。\n流落还相见，悲欢话所思。\n猜谗伤薏苡，愁暮向江蓠。\n泪尽㸔长劔，心闲寄钓𢇁\n水云初起重，暮鸟逺来迟。\n稚子能吴语，新文怨楚词。\n怜君不得意，客鬓老南枝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07365.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07365","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}